sset/2104/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2104/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2104/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2104/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","#000000",[],{"contentTopicImage":52,"name":54,"slug":55},{"id":53,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"2429","Announcements","announcement",false,"2025-07-31","Figma IPO - IVP",{"id":60,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":61,"assetUrlXs":62,"assetUrlSm":63,"assetUrlMd":64,"assetUrlLg":65,"assetUrlXl":66,"assetUrlXxl":67},"1854","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1854/IVP_Figma_IPO_1200x630_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1854/xs_IVP_Figma_IPO_1200x630_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1854/sm_IVP_Figma_IPO_1200x630_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1854/md_IVP_Figma_IPO_1200x630_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1854/lg_IVP_Figma_IPO_1200x630_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1854/xl_IVP_Figma_IPO_1200x630_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1854/xxl_IVP_Figma_IPO_1200x630_073025.jpg",{"id":69,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"1856",[71,75],{"instance":72},{"__typename":73,"largeHeading":7,"heading":7,"body":74},"TextBlock","Four years ago, when we invested in [Figma](https://www.ivp.com/portfolio/figma/), we told CFO [Praveer Melwani](https://www.linkedin.com/in/praveer-melwani) something most founders and finance leaders don’t hear often enough:\r\n\r\n*\"There’s a mistake you’re almost guaranteed to make — not building your needle-moving Act II soon enough.\"*\r\n\r\nTech history is filled with one-hit wonders: companies that go public on the strength of a single product, with no clear path to sustained, diversified growth. Act II — the next needle-moving business line — is almost always an afterthought.\r\n\r\nPraveer, one of the early stars of the [Dropbox Strategic Finance team](https://www.ivp.com/content/the-strategic-finance-revolution/), took the challenge head-on. And then he, Dylan, Evan and the rest of the Figma team set out to prove us wrong.\r\n\r\nAnd they did.\r\n\r\nOver the years, Figma rolled out a bold suite of new products, including:\r\n\r\n- **FigJam**, a whiteboard for team brainstorming\r\n- **Dev Mode**, streamlining design-to-engineering workflows\r\n- **Figma Sites**, for designing and launching websites\r\n- **Figma Make**, leveraging AI to help anyone build an app\r\n\r\nEach one extended Figma’s design-first magic into new surfaces — without diluting the core. 76% of Figma customers use 2+ products. And with 132% net dollar retention, they’re successfully expanding the Figma footprint across products and teams.\r\n\r\nAlong the way, we partnered Praveer and his team as they hired candidates, set revenue targets, thought through their acquisition strategy and, more recently, prepared for their IPO. And as if we didn’t love Figma enough, their CMO is a [member of the IVP (and my) family](https://www.linkedin.com/in/sheilavashee/).\r\n\r\nToday, Figma looks like a generational company: A strong business. A product roadmap with real velocity. A community that can pack the Moscone Center with 10,000 cheering, screaming, [breakdancing](https://x.com/fredzaw/status/1805827775443431777) superfans.\r\n\r\nFigma’s IPO isn’t just a milestone for the company — it’s a reminder that great teams don’t wait for Act II. They write it early.",{"instance":76},{"__typename":77,"heading":7,"image":78},"FullImage",{"id":79,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":80,"assetUrlXs":81,"assetUrlSm":82,"assetUrlMd":83,"assetUrlLg":84,"assetUrlXl":85,"assetUrlXxl":86},"1857","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1857/IVP_Figma_IPO_1840x1240_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1857/xs_IVP_Figma_IPO_1840x1240_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1857/sm_IVP_Figma_IPO_1840x1240_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1857/md_IVP_Figma_IPO_1840x1240_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1857/lg_IVP_Figma_IPO_1840x1240_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1857/xl_IVP_Figma_IPO_1840x1240_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1857/xxl_IVP_Figma_IPO_1840x1240_073025.jpg",{"id":88,"assetUrl":8},"490",{"assetUrl":8},[],"figmas-next-act-going-public",[93],{"fullName":94,"teamSubcategories":95,"slug":106,"image":107,"abbreviatedTitle":116,"focusAreas":117,"emailAddress":118,"bio":119},"Ajay Vashee",[96,102],{"name":97,"slug":98,"teamCategory":99},"Apps","apps",{"name":100,"slug":101},"Investors","investors",{"name":103,"slug":104,"teamCategory":105},"Digital Health","digital-health",{"name":100,"slug":101},"ajay-vashee",{"id":108,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":109,"assetUrlXs":110,"assetUrlSm":111,"assetUrlMd":112,"assetUrlLg":113,"assetUrlXl":114,"assetUrlXxl":115},"2016","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","General Partner","Artificial Intelligence, Future of Work, Finance Transformation","ajay@ivp.com","I came to IVP from Dropbox, where I guided the company through its IPO and first several years as a public company. As a first-time CFO, I stepped into a leadership role early in my career, and learned firsthand how to build, support and inspire a high-performing team. I also grew to embrace the uncertainty that’s inherent to leading a growth-stage company. I’m most proud of the impact my organization had—helping Dropbox scale to billions in ARR and hundreds of millions of users. \r\n\r\nAs an investor, I’m always on the lookout for companies that are solving big problems in market categories on the precipice of disruptive change. My experience as an operator is invaluable to my work at IVP, and I’m committed to being a hands-on, active partner to every company I invest in. I’m also focused on helping IVP build platform capabilities closely attuned to the needs of our founders. It’s why we launched the CFO Collective—the first community of its kind—which brings the brightest minds in strategic finance together to support one another and lay the groundwork for the future.",{"id":121,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":122,"assetUrlXs":123,"assetUrlSm":124,"assetUrlMd":125,"assetUrlLg":126,"assetUrlXl":127,"assetUrlXxl":128},"1855","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1855/IVP_Figma_IPO_800x840_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1855/xs_IVP_Figma_IPO_800x840_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1855/sm_IVP_Figma_IPO_800x840_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1855/md_IVP_Figma_IPO_800x840_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1855/lg_IVP_Figma_IPO_800x840_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1855/xl_IVP_Figma_IPO_800x840_073025.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1855/xxl_IVP_Figma_IPO_800x840_073025.jpg","Figma’s Next Act: Going Public ",1790351925472]